data: {"id": "f339a6f0e3f24036-thinking-parallel_evidence-1631", "run_id": "f339a6f0e3f24036", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集完成\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 关键事实 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| **Kubernetes Events** | 高价值 | 镜像 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 拉取失败，**error: code = NotFound** |\n| **Metrics** | present | `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending), `waiting_reason=ImagePullBackOff`, restarts=0 |\n| **Logs** | empty | 容器从未启动，无应用日志 |\n| **Tracing** | empty | 容器未运行，无流量/链路 |\n| **Topology** | present | Pod 运行在 node2，容器 app, Pod IP 172.16.104.37 |\n\n### 因果判断\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789441951364, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

